From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Sun, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 3rd_party/sapien-vulkan-2: disable Vulkan-Headers' C++
 module target

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not riscv64-specific: hits any build using GCC >= 14 with a Makefiles/Xcode generator, not yet submitted]

Vulkan-Headers (FetchContent'd by sapien-vulkan-2/cmake/vulkan.cmake,
pinned to vulkan-sdk-1.3.290.0) auto-enables VULKAN_HEADERS_ENABLE_MODULE
whenever the compiler looks capable of C++20 modules
(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID STREQUAL "GNU" AND VERSION_GREATER_EQUAL "14.0"
among the other compilers it checks), regardless of whether the
*generator* can actually build them. Upstream's own Linux Docker image
(docker/Dockerfile) uses gcc-toolset-11 (GCC 11), so it never reaches
that branch. manylinux_2_39_riscv64's system GCC is >= 14, and SAPIEN's
setup.py never passes -G, so CMake defaults to the Unix Makefiles
generator -- which does not support CXX_MODULES FILE_SETs at all, so
configure dies outright:

  CMake Error in sapien_build/_sapien_deps/vulkan-src/CMakeLists.txt:
    The target named "Vulkan-Module" has C++ sources that may use
    modules, but modules are not supported by this generator:
      Unix Makefiles

sapien-vulkan-2 (and SAPIEN) never consume Vulkan::VulkanHppModule --
only the plain Vulkan::Headers interface target -- so force the option
off before populating, which both sidesteps the generator restriction
and skips building a module nothing links against.

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 3rd_party/sapien-vulkan-2/cmake/vulkan.cmake | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/3rd_party/sapien-vulkan-2/cmake/vulkan.cmake b/3rd_party/sapien-vulkan-2/cmake/vulkan.cmake
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/3rd_party/sapien-vulkan-2/cmake/vulkan.cmake
+++ b/3rd_party/sapien-vulkan-2/cmake/vulkan.cmake
@@ -7,6 +7,8 @@ FetchContent_Declare(
     GIT_PROGRESS TRUE
 )

+set(VULKAN_HEADERS_ENABLE_MODULE OFF CACHE BOOL "sapien-vulkan-2 only uses Vulkan::Headers, never Vulkan::VulkanHppModule, and the Unix Makefiles generator SAPIEN builds with cannot emit CXX_MODULES FILE_SETs" FORCE)
+
 FetchContent_GetProperties(vulkan)
 if(NOT vulkan_POPULATED)
   FetchContent_Populate(vulkan)
--
2.50.1
